# Tests 1d/1e: throughput of a production-size cell (x10; -var size 333 = 13824 atoms by default, 444 = 32768) and the
# cost of on-the-fly analysis. Run with -var ana <0|1>. NPT 600 K from the rocksalt cell: 500 warm-up steps, then a timed 3000-step run.
# ana=1 includes common/in.analysis at its production interval (thermo_ps = 1 ps) plus a trajectory dump with
# the per-atom q4 columns at 5 ps; ana=0 runs the bare potential.
# Read "Performance:" from the second run of each log.

